<p><strong>An AI receptionist is an AI assistant that answers customer calls and chat messages for a spa, salon or clinic, handles the common questions and helps the customer book. Zennly can provide one on request, set up with your own services, branches and rules, and it places each booking request in your Zennly schedule.</strong></p>
<p>In Nepal, most bookings still start with a phone call or a message. They arrive while the therapist is mid-treatment, the stylist has a client in the chair or the branch is closed. The customer who does not get an answer usually calls the next business.</p>
<h2>What it does</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Answers calls and chats.</strong> Common questions about services, branches and timings, and booking requests, by phone and by chat.</li>
<li><strong>Works outside opening hours.</strong> It picks up in the evening and while your team is busy.</li>
<li><strong>Feeds your schedule.</strong> Requests land in the same schedule as every online and walk-in booking.</li>
<li><strong>Keeps your team in control.</strong> It does not replace your reception. It covers the calls you cannot take.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Why it matters for no-shows and WhatsApp</h2>
<p>Bookings taken in chat apps are easily lost or double-booked. An assistant that writes into one schedule avoids both. Read <a href="/blog/stop-taking-bookings-on-whatsapp-nepal/">why to stop taking bookings on WhatsApp</a> and <a href="/blog/reduce-no-shows-salon-spa-nepal/">how to reduce no-shows</a>.</p>
<h2>How to get it</h2>
<p>The AI receptionist is available on request. Ask for it in your demo and we will set it up for your business. See the <a href="/features/ai-assistant/">AI receptionist page</a> for details, or <a href="#try-free" data-trial-open>try the free Zennly demo</a> first.</p>
